# Netlify Redirects Configuration for Marvi Mart
# 1. Seamlessly map any legacy or cached /src/assets/images/* paths to /images/*
/src/assets/images/*  /images/:splat  200

# 2. Allow direct access to uploaded product images if present
/uploads/*  /uploads/:splat  200

# 3. Single Page App (SPA) fallback to index.html for all client-side routes
/*  /index.html  200
